1. PyTorch-CycleGAN
-------------------
Source:  https://github.com/ai-tor/PyTorch-CycleGAN
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (the LICENSE file of this repository
         is the LICENSE file of that project)

This repository is a derivative of PyTorch-CycleGAN. Derived files:
- cycle_train.py, cycle_train_unet.py, style_train.py, style_train_unet.py,
  spa_train.py: argument parsing, data loading and the structure of the
  training loop (from the upstream "train" script)
- cycle_test.py, cycle_test_unet.py, style_test.py, style_test_unet.py,
  spa_test.py: argument parsing, data loading and test loop
  (from the upstream "test" script)
- utils/utils.py: tensor2image, Logger, ReplayBuffer, LambdaLR,
  weights_init_normal (Logger extended with an epoch timer and a configurable
  Visdom server)
- utils/datasets.py: ImageDataset (ImageDatasetPath is a modified copy that
  also returns the file paths)


2. pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix
-------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/junyanz/pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix
License: BSD-style licenses, reproduced below from the LICENSE file of that
         project

Files containing code adapted from its models/networks.py:
- models/cyclegan_models.py (generators, discriminators, losses and helper
  functions)
- models/style_models.py (init_weights, init_net, define_D,
  NLayerDiscriminator, GANLoss and the recursive U-Net structure of
