Other code
----------
The remaining code (the style-modulated generators, mapping network and AdaIN
layers in models/style_models.py, the VGG-19 style loss, models/spa_gan.py,
and the evaluation, timing and data-preparation scripts) was written for this
project. The StyleGAN components follow Karras et al., "A Style-Based
Generator Architecture for Generative Adversarial Networks", CVPR 2019.
models/spa_gan.py is the authors' re-implementation of SPA GAN (Emami et
al., IEEE Trans. Multimedia, 2021); it is not the official SPA GAN code.

The CUT comparison uses the official CUT code
(https://github.com/taesungp/contrastive-unpaired-translation), which is not
included here. measure_cut_inference_time.py imports it at run time.
